OL,3,ATories accuse Burnham of 'taking money'
OL,4,Afrom pensioners as PM defends plan to
OL,5,Aadjust triple lock
OL,6,
OL,7,FAdjusting the triple lock on state
OL,8,Fpensions to fund social care reforms in
OL,9,FEngland "is about helping pensioners",
OL,10,FAndy Burnham says
OL,12,FAsked by the BBC's Nick Robinson why
OL,13,Fhe's hitting pensioners rather than the
OL,14,Fwealthiest, the PM says his plan will
OL,15,Fhelp those who are "at risk of paying
OL,16,Fruinous care costs"
OL,18,F"Triple lock" means the state pension
OL,19,Fcurrently increases annually in line
OL,20,Fwith inflation, average wage growth, or
OL,21,F2.5%, whichever is highest
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
